  "description": "The VMAX VX2 Hub impresses with a nearly silent direct drive: The V-Torque R10 hub motor delivers up to 1900 W peak power and effortlessly handles inclines of up to 35% – quiet, low-maintenance, and efficient over long distances.\n\nUp to 90 km range – available with either a 13.0 Ah or 18.2 Ah battery\n\nV-Core Boost Controller – thermomagnetic temperature control, regenerative braking logic, and smart charging electronics with up to 4.5 A\n\nOil pressure suspension in the front, elastomer suspension in the rear – low maintenance, weatherproof, and leveling\n\nMechanical disc brake in the rear, drum brake in the front – for safe, controlled braking performance\n\n3.5\" TFT display with V-Sense light sensor – automatic lights and self-regulating brightness\n\nTechnical specifications: up to 35% climbing ability · IPX6 protection rating · max. 130 kg load capacity · turn signals front and rear · USB-C charging port · In-app turn-by-turn navigation",
